      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We need the ability to add secondary languages too so we don't have this awkward moment where everyone is speaking broken Japanese when we find out we're native English or native Korean speakers etc. (though it is pretty funny)\n\nLike if someone doesn't speak English but they can see they should speak Japanese at me instead of Korean (I've got a loooong ways to go before I'll be able to understand Korean)",
